HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The ddeevvffss file system first appeared in FreeBSD 2.0.  It became the pre‐
     ferred method for accessing devices in FreeBSD 5.0 and the only method in
     FreeBSD 6.0.  The ddeevvffss manual page first appeared in FreeBSD 2.2.

